# ° Opening index.html straight from the disk (file://) instead of a server
Access to script at 'file:///home/user/famouskai/sw.js' from origin 'null' has been Blocked by CORS policy.
sw.js:1  Failed to load resource: net::ERR_FAILED
index.html:1525 Service Worker registration failed: TypeError: The URL protocol of the current origin ('null') is not supported.
# Lesson: file:// works for editing, never for offline mode. Use a local server or the hosted app.

